      `the information is not generally known in the trade or business that uses or may use that information` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the information has economic value from not being generally known` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the information is the subject of efforts that are reasonable under the circumstances to maintain its secrecy` IS A BOOLEAN
