    IF    `the thing is information`
      AND `the information is not generally known in the trade or business that uses or may use that information`
      AND `the information has economic value from not being generally known`
      AND `the information is the subject of efforts that are reasonable under the circumstances to maintain its secrecy`
    THEN JUST TRUE
